{"text": "Saturday.\n\n\"One minute!\" says Grandpa.\n\nFirst, the photo. He holds the flowers and the phone.\n\nTouch here. Smile.\n\nIt is Grandpa with the flowers. It is a nice photo! He touches Send.\n\nBehind the door, there are many happy noises. Phones!\n\nGrandpa stops. What is that?\n\nGrandpa opens the door.\n\nEce is there with her mum and dad. Uncle Murat and the cousins are there. Mert is there, too. The man from the bread shop is there. He has a very big cake.\n\n\"Surprise!\" they say.\n\n\"But it is your birthday, Ece,\" says Grandpa.\n\nEce kisses him. \"Yes, Grandpa. And I want my birthday here. With you.\"\n\n\"We are in Mert's flat all week!\"\n\nGrandpa looks at Mert. \"The blue curtain!\"\n\nMert smiles. \"Yes. My curtain. And your phone is my job.\"\n\nThe family carries the party into the flat.\n\nOn the wall, there are many photos. His ear. The sky. And his foot!\n\n\"Your phone sends us every photo,\" says Ece.\n\n\"Oh no,\" says Grandpa.\n\nBut the family loves the photos. Uncle Murat likes the sky. Mert likes the ear. Everyone loves the foot!\n\nGrandpa shows them his nice photo.\n\n\"It is nice, Grandpa,\" says Ece. \"But I love the foot.\"\n\nGrandpa laughs. His new phone does everything wrong. But today, wrong is right.", "textSha256": "4c0ec9c271b257c2485bc8b21152ece4916fad1f1a9226d07e433be2705befe7", "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL", "model_id": "eleven_v3", "speed": 0.9, "lang": "en", "parts": 1, "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "a", "t", "u", "r", "d", "a", "y", ".", "\n", "\n", "\"", "O", "n", "e", " ", "m", "i", "n", "u", "t", "e", "!", "\"", " ", "s", "a", "y", "s", " ", "G", "r", "a", "n", "d", "p", "a", ".", "\n", "\n", "F", "i", "r", "s", "t", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "h", "o", "t", "o", ".", " ", "H", "e", " ", "h", "o", "l", "d", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "l", "o", "w", "e", "r", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "h", "o", "n", "e", ".", "\n", "\n", "T", "o", "u", "c", "h", " ", "h